# act reads this, but a *project* .actrc may only set flags that cannot reach
# host resources - so the useful `-P windows-latest=-self-hosted` mapping is not
# allowed here. Use scripts/act-local.ps1, which passes it on the command line.
#
# (Kept as documentation for anyone who runs act directly.)
#
#   act -l --trust-project-actrc
#   act -j filter-only -P windows-latest=-self-hosted --trust-project-actrc
